{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":188,"title":"14. Paṭhamavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvakānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ rattaññūnaṁ yadidaṁ aññāsikoṇḍañño."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Mahāpaññānaṁ yadidaṁ sāriputto."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Iddhimantānaṁ yadidaṁ mahāmoggallāno."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Dhutavādānaṁ yadidaṁ mahākassapo."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Dibbacakkhukānaṁ yadidaṁ anuruddho."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Uccākulikānaṁ yadidaṁ bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Mañjussarānaṁ yadidaṁ lakuṇḍaka bhaddiyo."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Sīhanādikānaṁ yadidaṁ piṇḍolabhāradvājo."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Dhammakathikānaṁ yadidaṁ puṇṇo mantāṇiputto."},
{"v":"10","t":"… saṅkhittena bhāsitassa vitthārena atthaṁ vibhajantānaṁ yadidaṁ mahākaccāno”ti. Vaggo paṭhamo."}
]}
